<title>UK: Centrobanca sets 400 bln lire 7-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Centrobanca sets 400 bln lire 7-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following exhangeable bond was announced by joint lead managers IMI Sigeco, BCA Pop Novara and Istituto Centrale Delle Banche Popolari.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CENTROBANCO</p>
<p> AMT    400 BLN LIRE  BASE     **6M-RIBOR  MATURITY    09.JUN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +35 BP    PAY DATE    09.JUN.97</p>
<p> LISTING    MILAN     ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   UNDISC</p>
<p> NOTES     **TRANSFORMABLE INTO 8.0 PCT ANNUAL COUPON ON</p>
<p>09.JUN.00</p>
<p>		 AT THE ISSUERS OPTION.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
